<title>HONG KONG: Chairman cuts SAS Dragon stake to 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Chairman cuts SAS Dragon stake to 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>S.A.S. Dragon Holdings Ltd said its chairman and controlling shareholder Stanley Yim had reduced his stake in the company to 36.2 percent from 39.9 percent by selling 10 million shares on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
